### Appointment Scheduler — REST Client scratch file (Constitution Principle II)
### Feature 007: Clinic Hours, Doctor Availability & Appointment Scheduling.
### Set @token after logging in (POST /api/v1/auth/login, feature 001's onboarding-api.yaml).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_A_BEARER_TOKEN
@clinicId = REPLACE_WITH_A_CLINIC_ID
@doctorId = REPLACE_WITH_A_DOCTOR_ID
@appointmentId = REPLACE_WITH_AN_APPOINTMENT_ID

### Get a Clinic's current profile (Clinic Admin, own clinic; or an associated Patient for working-hours only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit a Clinic's profile (name/address only — never the Registered ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riverside Clinic",
  "address": { "addressLine1": "1 River Rd", "city": "Riverside", "state": "CA", "zip": "92501", "country": "USA" }
}

### Get a Clinic's working-hours table (Clinic Admin, own clinic; or an associated Patient)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Replace a Clinic's entire working-hours table (all 7 days)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY", "isOpen": true, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "TUESDAY", "isOpen": true, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "WEDNESDAY", "isOpen": true, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "THURSDAY", "isOpen": true, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "FRIDAY", "isOpen": true, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "SATURDAY", "isOpen": false, "startTime": null, "endTime": null },
    { "dayOfWeek": "SUNDAY", "isOpen": false, "startTime": null, "endTime": null }
  ]
}

### List the current Doctor's own leave entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a leave for the current Doctor (full-day)
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-01",
  "fullDay": true
}

### Add a partial-day leave, resubmitted after a 409 LeaveConflictResponse to confirm cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-02",
  "fullDay": false,
  "startTime": "12:30",
  "endTime": "14:00",
  "confirmCancelConflicts": true
}

### List minimal bookable doctors for a clinic (Patient of that clinic, or its Clinic Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}/doctors/bookable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a doctor's available start times for a date/duration
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}/available-slots?date=2026-09-01&durationMinutes=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book an appointment (Patient only, for themselves)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicId": "{{clinicId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "date": "2026-09-01",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30
}

### Cancel a SCHEDULED appointment (Clinic Admin of its clinic, or the owning Doctor)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark a SCHEDULED appointment COMPLETED (Clinic Admin of its clinic, or the owning Doctor)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List the current user's own appointments (Patient or Doctor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List every appointment for a clinic (Clinic Admin, own clinic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinics/{{clinicId}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
